{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E749_001.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MND_000_0_1#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Haru and I roamed the[n]snowy Shibuya streets[n]for quite some time...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "*giggle*",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "The city was amazing!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's go again sometime.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Are you cold?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Merry Christmas.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Yes, let's!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "No, I'm okay.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Yes! Merry Christmas!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "All of my Christmases before this[n]were either spent alone because[n]Father was so busy...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Or accompanying him to one of[n]his boring work parties...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's have fun this year.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's take it easy.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_1_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You won't be alone anymore.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_3_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Yes, I'd like that.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_3_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Maybe next year, I'll grow a fir tree[n]to celebrate the occasion.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I'm so happy to hear you say that...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_5_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Maybe next year, I'll grow a fir tree[n]to celebrate the occasion.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_006_7_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I won't be able to see Haru[n]again after tomorrow...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_006_7_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We spent a long time talking...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Oh yes, before I forget...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "This is for everything you've done.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Thank you.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_009_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll treasure it always.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I'm glad you like it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Christmas is incredible!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Um, I know this is a somewhat abrupt[n]change of subject...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "But are you following the news on Shido?[n]Well... of course you are. It's always on...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Honestly, I'm starting to get a little scared.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "The police investigation will probably[n]lead straight to the Phantom Thieves.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "If that happens, will we not be able[n]to see each other anymore?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "If that happens, there's no telling what[n]they'll do to you or your teammates.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "There's even the possibility that they'll[n]fabricate a crime and move to arrest[n]you all.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I have to turn myself in to[n]make sure Haru stays safe...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "But telling her about it would[n]only cause her to panic...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "...What's the matter?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's nothing.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_017_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm sorry.",
   "uk": "Вибачте.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "...Huh?",
   "uk": "...Га?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "......",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Oh, I'm sorry. You made time for me[n]and I just ruined it...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I think I should head home.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll walk you back.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Be careful.",
   "uk": "Будь обережний.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "It's okay. I can take a taxi.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "...Yes.",
   "uk": "...Так.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "...I know you're concealing[n]something from me.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I just wish... you thought me reliable[n]enough to share that secret...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Good night.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I made Haru worry...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_027_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Even so, this is the only way...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}